    desc: "I designed this project by HTML5 , CSS3 , Bootstrap , JavaScript and React Js ,This First Project By React .",
    longDescripition:
      '<div class="project-description"><h3>💡 Project Description:</h3><p>A fully functional <strong>E-commerce Website</strong> built using <strong>React.js</strong> with <strong>Bootstrap</strong> for a responsive and user-friendly interface, and <strong>Redux Toolkit</strong> for efficient and well-structured state management. Product data is dynamically fetched from an <strong>external API</strong>, ensuring real and up-to-date products are always displayed.</p><p>The website consists of multiple key pages that cover the full user experience:</p><ul><li><strong>Home Page:</strong> Showcases featured products with a clean and simple layout.</li><li><strong>Products Page:</strong> Displays all available products with advanced filtering options, allowing users to refine results by category, price, or other attributes.</li><li><strong>Login Page:</strong> Includes form validation powered by Regex to ensure only valid credentials are accepted (e.g., proper email format and secure password input), enhancing security.</li><li><strong>Product Details Page:</strong> Provides in-depth information for each product, including images, description, price, and the option to add it to the cart.</li><li><strong>Shopping Cart Page:</strong> Allows users to review selected products, adjust quantities, or remove items.</li><li><strong>Checkout Page:</strong> The final step to complete the purchase; once the payment is made, the cart is automatically cleared for a fresh shopping experience.</li></ul><p><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 Days </p><h3>⚙ Technical Features:</h3><ul><li><strong>React + Redux Toolkit</strong> for state management (products, cart, authentication).</li><li><strong>Bootstrap</strong> for building a fully responsive design that adapts across mobile, tablet, and desktop.</li><li>Integration with an <strong>external API</strong> for dynamic product data fetching.</li><li><strong>Regex-based form validation</strong> to ensure accurate user input.</li><li><strong>End-to-end shopping experience:</strong> login → browse → filter → add to cart → checkout.</li></ul><h3>🎯 Final Outcome:</h3><p>A complete <strong>E-commerce platform</strong> that delivers a smooth and intuitive shopping experience, combining strong performance with a clean UI design, while following best practices in state management and data validation. </p><p><strong>View Project:</strong> <a href="https://youssef-magdy-19.github.io/Ecommerce-Website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Project Link</a></p></div>',
