    desc: "I designed this project by HTML5 , CSS3 , Bootstrap , JavaScript and React Js ,This First Project By React .",
    longDescripition:
      '<div class="project-description"><h3>💡 Project Description:</h3><p> A fully featured <strong>E-commerce Website</strong> developed with <strong>React.js</strong>, showcasing a modern and professional design with support for <strong>Dark & Light Mode</strong>to match user preferences. The site is fully responsive across all devices, with a custom <strong>Sidebar navigation</strong> on mobile for a seamless browsing experience.</p><p>Instead of fetching data from an external API, all user and product data is managed locally using a <strong>JSON file</strong>, ensuring complete control over data storage and retrieval.</p><p>The website includes multiple core pages covering the full shopping journey:</p><ul><li><strong>Home Page:</strong> A clean and elegant landing page highlighting products.</li><li><strong>Products Page:</strong> Displays all products with a Search bar and custom-designed filtering options (instead of the default &lt;select&gt; styling) for a polished UI.</li><li><strong>Login Page:</strong> After logging in, users are redirected to their Profile Page, where personal details are displayed.</li><li><strong>Product Details Page:</strong> Shows comprehensive product information and allows users to add reviews/comments. Only logged-in users can leave a comment, and their name is attached to it. Comments are persistent (remain after reloads), account-specific (different users see their own name), and product-specific (each product has its own unique set of comments).</li><li><strong>Shopping Cart Page:</strong> Enables users to review their selected items, update quantities, or remove products.</li><li><strong>Checkout Page:</strong> Finalizes the purchase process.</li><li><strong>Profile Page:</strong> Displays user details after login.</li><li><strong>Logout Flow:</strong> A confirmation modal pops up in the center of the screen, asking users to confirm before logging out.</li></ul><p><strong>Duration:</strong> 9 Days </p><h3>⚙ Technical Features:</h3><ul><li>Built with <strong>React</strong> and local <strong>JSON storage</strong> instead of an external API.</li><li><strong>Dark & Light Mode</strong> for personalized themes.</li><li>Custom <strong>Sidebar navigation</strong> on mobile devices.</li><li>Search and advanced filtering with custom-styled UI.</li><li><strong>Toast notifications</strong> for every action (adding/removing items, login, logout, checkout, etc.).</li><li><strong>Persistent Comments System:</strong> Users must log in to leave comments, their names are attached automatically, and comments remain saved even after reloads or switching accounts, while being isolated per product.</li><li>Fully responsive design optimized for mobile, tablet, and desktop.</li></ul><h3>🎯 Final Outcome:</h3><p>A modern and professional <strong>E-commerce platform</strong> delivering a premium UI/UX experience with advanced features like Dark/Light Mode, Toast notifications, a dedicated Profile Page, and a persistent product-specific comments system, making it close to a real-world online store.</p></div><p><strong>View Project:</strong> <a href="https://youssef-magdy-19.github.io/Ecommerce-Ostora-shop/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Project Link</a></p>',
